- A rollback is a hosted deploy under the same grant. Do it at once on a failed check; never redeploy or restart for any other reason. **If the API is not healthy after the way back: `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY` at once.** The owner (Kam) is told of any rollback (routing row C6): put it in the BLUF's first line.

